<!--
  The mark: a four-pointed star with thick arms and short points, traced from
  the same path as the web app's `components/brand/Star.tsx` so the two stores
  and the site show one shape.

  The 64-unit viewport of the source is mapped onto the 108 dp adaptive-icon
  canvas and scaled to 44 units, which keeps the whole star inside the 66 dp
  safe circle that every launcher mask leaves alone.
-->
